      "filename": "RAPPBODETALSPERRE, 29 APR 1990 (5054769603).jpg",
      "title": "File:RAPPBODETALSPERRE, 29 APR 1990 (5054769603).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/RAPPBODETALSPERRE%2C_29_APR_1990_%285054769603%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
